-- Sibling test module for `compiler/backend/core_validate.mdk` ([P-TEST-SIBLING]).
--
-- Each program is prelude-free and lowered without typechecking, through the
-- pipeline `compiler/entries/wasm_emit_main.mdk` and
-- `compiler/entries/llvm_emit_main.mdk` use, so a reference to a runtime extern
-- reaches the checked program with its canonical extern declaration identity.

